                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This is a win for patients and labs in #MN01!\n\nRecently, I introduced the Freedom for Laboratory Innovation and Testing Act\u2014critical legislation that protects lifesaving diagnostic tests from this burdensome rule that, if enacted, would have put lives at risk and hindered innovation",
