                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 6,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I had the incredible opportunity to visit @MayoClinic's Department of Radiation Oncology and get an up-close look at some of their cutting-edge radiation technology. Mayo\u2019s Edge and Ethos treatment machines give doctors and patients real-time information with millimeter precision, allowing treatments to be adjusted each day that a cancer patient\u2019s anatomy changes.\n\nThis technology is truly game-changing for cancer treatment and is just one of many reasons I am working to ensure Mayo has the support and resources to continue the numerous life-saving trials and research projects that will lead to a cure for this terrible disease.",
